1
00:00:26,040 --> 00:00:29,880
YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!

2
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,620
Your moves!

3
00:01:02,680 --> 00:01:05,620
Ready or not, here we come.

4
00:01:07,900 --> 00:01:09,959
We're not letting you in here, man.

5
00:01:10,440 --> 00:01:14,180
Oh, Yugi, I hope you guys are
getting close to finding Kaiba.

6
00:01:14,620 --> 00:01:16,857
There's only so long we'll
be able to keep Kimo and

7
00:01:16,940 --> 00:01:20,234
his thugs from getting in
here and unplugging your pots.

8
00:01:23,140 --> 00:01:25,493
Huh, I knew guys could be dirty as pigs.

9
00:01:25,660 --> 00:01:27,137
Didn't know they dressed the park.

10
00:01:27,220 --> 00:01:29,917
Hope you duel better than
you smell, you swine.

11
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:32,037
You know what I like about butterflies?

12
00:01:32,120 --> 00:01:33,400
They don't talk!

13
00:01:35,520 --> 00:01:36,600
Let's do it!

14
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:41,220
This card will clip her wings and
win us the Niwatori prize card!

15
00:01:42,100 --> 00:01:43,340
Flame Swordsman!

16
00:01:44,560 --> 00:01:46,520
Have I got a girl for you!

17
00:01:47,100 --> 00:01:47,980
Harpy Lady!

18
00:01:49,800 --> 00:01:50,780
Harpy Lady?

19
00:01:51,100 --> 00:01:53,300
I've definitely seen her before.

20
00:01:53,900 --> 00:01:55,597
Eh, the Swordsman will take her.

21
00:01:55,680 --> 00:01:56,640
I knew it.

22
00:01:56,840 --> 00:01:59,097
Pigs don't know about trap cards.

23
00:01:59,180 --> 00:02:00,920
Mirror Wall! No!

24
00:02:01,240 --> 00:02:04,757
Mirror Wall reflects my swordsman's
strike right back at him!

25
00:02:04,840 --> 00:02:07,260
Hey, I've seen this strategy before.

26
00:02:07,800 --> 00:02:10,240
Mai always used that combo. Can it be?

27
00:02:12,240 --> 00:02:15,980
My harpy lady really knows
how to bring home the bacon.

28
00:02:16,500 --> 00:02:17,820
Okay, that's it.

29
00:02:18,020 --> 00:02:21,138
There's only one duelist
that could be this annoying.

30
00:02:21,340 --> 00:02:22,940
Ready for the big finish?

31
00:02:23,320 --> 00:02:24,420
Rose Whip Attack!

32
00:02:25,140 --> 00:02:25,970
Hold on!

33
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:28,120
Stop Attack!

34
00:02:29,780 --> 00:02:31,320
Joey, is that you?

35
00:02:31,520 --> 00:02:33,226
What are you doing here, Mai?

36
00:02:34,380 --> 00:02:38,417
Yugi, Mokuba, I'm testing this
game for some suits at Kaiba Corps.

37
00:02:38,500 --> 00:02:40,457
Listen, you could be in danger, Mai.

38
00:02:40,540 --> 00:02:42,977
Yeah, those suits
kidnapped my big brother.

39
00:02:43,060 --> 00:02:44,857
Kaiba's in a temple across the desert.

40
00:02:44,940 --> 00:02:47,646
They've trapped his mind
in this virtual game.

41
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:48,830
Kaiba's here?

42
00:02:49,260 --> 00:02:53,077
And we need the Niwotori card to
cross the desert so we can rescue him.

43
00:02:53,160 --> 00:02:54,857
That's the prize card for this match.

44
00:02:54,940 --> 00:02:57,180
Back to the fight! What are you doing?

45
00:02:57,300 --> 00:02:59,040
I noticed crown's a fake.

46
00:02:59,180 --> 00:03:01,004
But they look really mad to me.

47
00:03:02,160 --> 00:03:06,157
We might have a problem getting out
of here without finishing the duel.

48
00:03:06,240 --> 00:03:10,837
Besides, even if we do escape, we still
won't find Kaiba without that Niwatori card.

49
00:03:10,920 --> 00:03:15,380
Well, I'm not so sure about crossing
a desert, but I'm over this place.

50
00:03:15,580 --> 00:03:18,580
And I'm positive that I
can get that Niwatori card.

51
00:03:18,900 --> 00:03:20,860
Harpy Lady, use Rose Whip!

52
00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:24,380
The Niwatori! Ha!

53
00:03:25,140 --> 00:03:27,717
Uh-oh, we're in trouble now! Run for it!

54
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:29,300
Don't let him go!

55
00:03:30,840 --> 00:03:32,193
Gotta reach the desert!

56
00:03:32,440 --> 00:03:34,440
Oh, this is much better than Duel.

57
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:37,670
Enough!

58
00:03:37,753 --> 00:03:40,460
Crowd control time! Go! Trap hole!

59
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:45,268
By the time they get around
this, we'll be across the desert.

60
00:03:47,160 --> 00:03:51,157
Okay, time to see if this card will
work like the old man said it would.

61
00:03:51,240 --> 00:03:52,946
Will you do the honors, mate?

62
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:55,380
Let's giddy up.

63
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:59,637
CSA and Kuiper Corp paid
you to come here, Mai?

64
00:03:59,720 --> 00:04:00,550
That's right.

65
00:04:00,660 --> 00:04:01,520
I wonder why.

66
00:04:01,840 --> 00:04:03,160
Probably to test it.

67
00:04:03,280 --> 00:04:07,637
To make sure everything would go according
to plan when they used it on my brother.

68
00:04:07,720 --> 00:04:10,800
Still, they couldn't have
planned on all of us. Huh?

69
00:04:11,060 --> 00:04:12,200
Look over there!

70
00:04:13,620 --> 00:04:14,738
It's an earthquake!

71
00:04:15,120 --> 00:04:16,600
No, it's something worse.

72
00:04:16,880 --> 00:04:19,517
It's another obstacle
programmed into the game.

73
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:21,540
What is it? Oh, no.

74
00:04:21,780 --> 00:04:23,197
It's a sandstone monster.

75
00:04:23,280 --> 00:04:26,080
We're never going to get past that!

76
00:04:35,320 --> 00:04:40,740
Alright then, I'll kick over the sand
castle with my red eyes black dragon!

77
00:04:42,040 --> 00:04:44,060
Red eyes black dragon!

78
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:46,460
Inferno Fire Blast!

79
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:48,190
Yeah!

80
00:04:48,880 --> 00:04:50,320
And buh-bye!

81
00:04:52,260 --> 00:04:53,880
Look, through the dust.

82
00:04:54,160 --> 00:04:55,454
Do you see what I see?

83
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:57,540
Some sort of ancient temple.

84
00:04:57,700 --> 00:04:59,577
That must be what we're looking for.

85
00:04:59,660 --> 00:05:01,277
Is that where they're keeping Kaiba?

86
00:05:01,360 --> 00:05:04,357
An old woman told us it was
the temple across the desert.

87
00:05:04,440 --> 00:05:05,517
So that's gotta be it.

88
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:06,717
Seto's gotta be there.

89
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:08,240
Go, drumsticks!

90
00:05:08,840 --> 00:05:11,020
Uh, guys, Joey named his chicken.

91
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:13,780
It's a Niwutori, mate. Whatever.

92
00:05:15,320 --> 00:05:16,150
Wow!

93
00:05:16,320 --> 00:05:18,220
Look at the size of that thing!

94
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:22,860
Phew, here at last.

95
00:05:24,880 --> 00:05:25,957
Mokuba, hold up!

96
00:05:26,040 --> 00:05:27,040
I'm coming, Seto!

97
00:05:27,280 --> 00:05:28,397
There's no stopping him.

98
00:05:28,480 --> 00:05:32,127
Come on, or else we're gonna
lose both of them Kaiba brothers.

99
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:33,510
Sheesh.

100
00:05:33,593 --> 00:05:35,157
This temple's seen better days.

101
00:05:35,240 --> 00:05:36,299
Definitely creepy.

102
00:05:36,640 --> 00:05:38,397
Yeah, let's try and stick together.

103
00:05:38,480 --> 00:05:39,310
Okay.

104
00:05:41,360 --> 00:05:42,280
Allow me.

105
00:05:45,620 --> 00:05:46,450
Huh?

106
00:05:46,660 --> 00:05:48,340
It's a labyrinth dungeon.

107
00:05:49,420 --> 00:05:53,185
It's like where we doled them
weirdo Paradox Brothers, huh, you?

108
00:05:55,900 --> 00:05:56,820
No use.

109
00:05:57,060 --> 00:05:58,017
It's locked tight.

110
00:05:58,100 --> 00:06:00,320
I'm totally freaked. It's all right.

111
00:06:00,780 --> 00:06:03,237
Remember that this is all
a game and we'd never reach

112
00:06:03,320 --> 00:06:05,937
the end of this adventure
by going backwards anyway.

113
00:06:06,020 --> 00:06:09,840
Which means we gotta go through
that maze to find Kaiba.

114
00:06:12,380 --> 00:06:13,615
Someone's in trouble.

115
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:14,560
I'm on it!

116
00:06:15,180 --> 00:06:16,637
Watch where you're going, Joey.

117
00:06:16,720 --> 00:06:20,360
Wait, that doofus will do
anything to meet a girl.

118
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:23,820
I guess he realizes I'm
way out of his need.

119
00:06:25,900 --> 00:06:26,780
What now?

120
00:06:27,220 --> 00:06:28,280
A labyrinth tank!

121
00:06:30,480 --> 00:06:31,840
It's gaining on us!

122
00:06:32,380 --> 00:06:33,697
Joey, watch out!

123
00:06:33,780 --> 00:06:35,251
Left, right, left, right.

124
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:38,380
Gotta go now! Tank!

125
00:06:39,580 --> 00:06:40,540
Another one!

126
00:06:41,160 --> 00:06:43,497
There's no way we're
getting by that thing.

127
00:06:43,580 --> 00:06:45,317
There's tanks coming from every direction.

128
00:06:45,400 --> 00:06:46,320
We're boxed in!

129
00:06:47,900 --> 00:06:49,920
Okay, anybody here got a plan?

130
00:06:50,100 --> 00:06:52,860
Yeah, get past those
tanks You got a plan B?

131
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:56,737
Otherwise we're gonna have more
holes in us than Swiss cheese

132
00:06:56,820 --> 00:06:58,640
I'll use my magical hats

133
00:07:02,640 --> 00:07:05,437
I love that trick You got us out of there

134
00:07:05,520 --> 00:07:08,860
just in time Now let's
move this party Ouch,

135
00:07:09,080 --> 00:07:11,520
Joey, that's my foot Sorry So,

136
00:07:11,860 --> 00:07:14,978
now we're in the clear Some
nice thinking there, Yugi

137
00:07:16,640 --> 00:07:18,977
Guys, those tanks are coming after us.

138
00:07:19,060 --> 00:07:20,178
Which way do we go?

139
00:07:20,960 --> 00:07:23,740
Look, another fairy, like we saw before.

140
00:07:25,220 --> 00:07:30,102
Hey, I bet it's one of them fairies that
they put in games to help the players out.

141
00:07:30,580 --> 00:07:31,980
Maybe she can help us.

142
00:07:32,180 --> 00:07:34,997
Yeah, it looks like maybe
she wants us to follow her.

143
00:07:35,080 --> 00:07:35,910
Let's do it.

144
00:07:35,993 --> 00:07:37,937
Think she can lead us to my brother?

145
00:07:38,020 --> 00:07:40,160
Ew, you're bound. Who's that?

146
00:07:41,900 --> 00:07:43,057
Check it out, Mokuba.

147
00:07:43,140 --> 00:07:45,837
Looks like that fairy's
turned you into a girl.

148
00:07:45,920 --> 00:07:46,750
Great.

149
00:07:46,833 --> 00:07:47,663
Can she make you smart?

150
00:07:47,746 --> 00:07:48,617
They look like...

151
00:07:48,700 --> 00:07:50,600
They could be twins. Totally.

152
00:07:51,220 --> 00:07:52,497
We heard someone scream.

153
00:07:52,580 --> 00:07:53,410
Are you all right?

154
00:07:53,493 --> 00:07:55,000
I lost Iru, my guide.

155
00:07:55,220 --> 00:07:56,940
Well, we're all here now.

156
00:07:57,140 --> 00:07:59,434
So can you get us out of this rat trap?

157
00:07:59,860 --> 00:08:00,900
I'm lost, too.

158
00:08:02,920 --> 00:08:05,280
But Iru will find a way out for us.

159
00:08:06,300 --> 00:08:07,697
I see the end of the maze.

160
00:08:07,780 --> 00:08:08,610
All right.

161
00:08:08,693 --> 00:08:09,561
We're home free.

162
00:08:10,820 --> 00:08:12,037
Did I say home free?

163
00:08:12,120 --> 00:08:13,737
I meant in deep trouble.

164
00:08:13,820 --> 00:08:16,677
I can't think of anything that'll
beat a monster that strong.

165
00:08:16,760 --> 00:08:18,642
He could crush us in one attack.

166
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:27,857
Those Kaiba Corp crooks must have put
Gate Guardian in the game to stop us.

167
00:08:27,940 --> 00:08:28,937
How do we beat it?

168
00:08:29,020 --> 00:08:31,667
We can overcome anything
by working together.

169
00:08:31,960 --> 00:08:32,880
Right on, you.

170
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:34,580
We'll team up. Let's go.

171
00:08:34,820 --> 00:08:38,837
I'll combine my red-eyes black
dragon with my summon skull and

172
00:08:38,920 --> 00:08:44,200
infuse them with a polymerization
card to form the Black Skull Dragon!

173
00:08:44,760 --> 00:08:45,590
Yeah!

174
00:08:47,940 --> 00:08:51,560
Great try, guys, but we still
need even more attack power.

175
00:08:51,800 --> 00:08:52,860
I hate this.

176
00:08:53,040 --> 00:08:54,657
Everything's rigged against us.

177
00:08:54,740 --> 00:08:55,570
Just wait.

178
00:08:55,820 --> 00:08:57,740
I still got dragon nails.

179
00:08:58,020 --> 00:09:00,720
It raises our attack power by 700 points.

180
00:09:01,240 --> 00:09:02,593
Molten Fireball Attack!

181
00:09:04,680 --> 00:09:05,960
That's amazing.

182
00:09:06,400 --> 00:09:08,120
You're all so brave.

183
00:09:08,360 --> 00:09:10,137
So much like the Heroes of Legend.

184
00:09:10,220 --> 00:09:11,380
Eh, it was nothing.

185
00:09:11,600 --> 00:09:14,220
Heroes of legend? Oh,
my lady! Is that you?

186
00:09:14,460 --> 00:09:15,290
Oh, my lady!

187
00:09:15,373 --> 00:09:16,203
Is that you?

188
00:09:16,286 --> 00:09:17,116
Is everything all right?

189
00:09:17,199 --> 00:09:18,029
Hannah!

190
00:09:18,112 --> 00:09:20,720
My lady, we've been
worried sick about you.

191
00:09:21,820 --> 00:09:25,240
Oh, I see you've made some
new friends. They saved me.

192
00:09:25,340 --> 00:09:27,928
They're the bravest
warriors I've ever seen.

193
00:09:28,040 --> 00:09:28,870
Oh!

194
00:09:29,420 --> 00:09:33,020
As thanks, I'd like to invite
them as guests to the palace.

195
00:09:42,980 --> 00:09:44,340
Where am I?

196
00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:46,360
You're with me, Seto Kaiba.

197
00:09:47,100 --> 00:09:47,930
Huh?

198
00:09:48,160 --> 00:09:51,940
Witty Phantom, you took me
prisoner in my own game? Yes.

199
00:09:52,160 --> 00:09:53,097
Then release me.

200
00:09:53,180 --> 00:09:54,220
I command you to.

201
00:09:54,380 --> 00:09:56,497
This is no longer your world to command.

202
00:09:56,580 --> 00:09:58,337
Your game's been reprogrammed.

203
00:09:58,420 --> 00:10:00,297
You're late to the party, Kaiba.

204
00:10:00,380 --> 00:10:02,040
Gee, I never liked parties.

205
00:10:02,360 --> 00:10:03,617
But you're the guest of honor.

206
00:10:03,700 --> 00:10:05,200
Or at least you will be.

207
00:10:05,580 --> 00:10:06,600
Very soon.

208
00:10:07,560 --> 00:10:08,660
You see, Kaiba,

209
00:10:08,840 --> 00:10:13,317
you will have the great privilege of
being our offering to the Mythic Dragon.

210
00:10:13,400 --> 00:10:17,420
Till then, your misery will be in
my capable hands. That's enough.

211
00:10:17,740 --> 00:10:18,799
Override protocol.

212
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:20,296
End this simulation.

213
00:10:22,060 --> 00:10:24,060
I told you things have changed.

214
00:10:24,320 --> 00:10:25,657
Your code's been rewritten,

215
00:10:25,740 --> 00:10:29,257
and now all your silly safety
precautions are a thing of the past.

216
00:10:29,340 --> 00:10:33,317
Now excuse me, there's so much to do
before the other offering is brought here.

217
00:10:33,400 --> 00:10:34,230
Huh?

218
00:10:34,313 --> 00:10:35,143
Another offering?

219
00:10:35,226 --> 00:10:38,817
I know you love the spotlight,
but you'll just have to share.

220
00:10:38,900 --> 00:10:40,040
Come back!

221
00:10:42,260 --> 00:10:45,497
Well, I still don't know what to
make of this crazy game world,

222
00:10:45,580 --> 00:10:48,377
but I like this part a
lot better than that maze.

223
00:10:48,460 --> 00:10:49,700
I like Idina.

224
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:52,557
At least she knows how
to travel in high style.

225
00:10:52,640 --> 00:10:53,470
That's true.

226
00:10:53,760 --> 00:10:57,617
Mokuba, you should be flattered that
Kaiba based such a cool character on you.

227
00:10:57,700 --> 00:10:58,530
On me?

228
00:10:59,560 --> 00:11:02,000
Yeah, on you, my lady.

229
00:11:03,220 --> 00:11:04,700
Look at that!

230
00:11:05,800 --> 00:11:07,180
Huh? Whoa.

231
00:11:08,540 --> 00:11:09,370
Excellent.

232
00:11:09,500 --> 00:11:11,297
Hope they got food in this game.

233
00:11:11,380 --> 00:11:13,400
Gee, I just hope they can help us.

234
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:15,600
We need to find Seto.

235
00:11:21,560 --> 00:11:23,140
Check out this pad.

236
00:11:26,600 --> 00:11:29,480
It seems Eru has taken a liking to you.

237
00:11:29,580 --> 00:11:31,100
Is this your palace?

238
00:11:31,480 --> 00:11:32,380
Why, yes.

239
00:11:32,900 --> 00:11:37,800
I am the princess of this land,
Simlao, Princess Adina. Princess?

240
00:11:41,660 --> 00:11:42,840
Careful, everyone.

241
00:11:43,120 --> 00:11:45,944
Keep your hands and feet
away from Joey's mouth.

242
00:11:47,960 --> 00:11:49,120
Are you okay?

243
00:11:50,400 --> 00:11:51,635
Happens all the time.

244
00:11:53,040 --> 00:11:53,870
Disgusting.

245
00:11:53,960 --> 00:11:57,597
Princess Adina, do you have
any news of my brother, Seto?

246
00:11:57,680 --> 00:11:58,700
Well,

247
00:11:58,900 --> 00:12:00,797
I didn't want to say anything before,

248
00:12:00,880 --> 00:12:05,300
but people often disappear when it
is time for the offerings. Offerings?

249
00:12:05,620 --> 00:12:06,720
What do you mean?

250
00:12:06,900 --> 00:12:08,197
Every year at this time,

251
00:12:08,280 --> 00:12:10,737
offerings are collected
from this and another

252
00:12:10,820 --> 00:12:13,938
kingdom so that the mythic
dragon can be resurrected.

253
00:12:14,700 --> 00:12:16,140
Ah, the mythic dragon?

254
00:12:16,400 --> 00:12:19,460
The other kingdom has already
put up their offering,

255
00:12:19,760 --> 00:12:22,680
some stranger from a
distant land. That's Zeto!

256
00:12:22,880 --> 00:12:24,540
Please tell me where he is!

257
00:12:24,660 --> 00:12:27,277
He's in a dark castle floating in the sky.

258
00:12:27,360 --> 00:12:28,660
A dark castle?

259
00:12:28,880 --> 00:12:30,586
Why does that sound familiar?

260
00:12:30,760 --> 00:12:32,466
The Castle of Dark Illusions?

261
00:12:32,640 --> 00:12:34,560
That painting tells the tale.

262
00:12:34,880 --> 00:12:37,557
We have passed down the
legend for generations.

263
00:12:37,640 --> 00:12:41,464
Long ago, a hero escaped that
dreaded castle on a flying machine.

264
00:12:41,580 --> 00:12:44,977
It is said he hid his vessel
in Simlau a thousand years ago.

265
00:12:45,060 --> 00:12:49,077
His ship was never found, and there's
no other way to reach the dark castle.

266
00:12:49,160 --> 00:12:51,278
We could fly there on Joey's dragon.

267
00:12:51,480 --> 00:12:53,740
A magic barrier protects the castle.

268
00:12:54,020 --> 00:12:56,117
No dual monsters can penetrate it.

269
00:12:56,200 --> 00:12:57,540
Oh, no.

270
00:12:58,420 --> 00:12:59,480
Don't you worry.

271
00:12:59,760 --> 00:13:02,017
Just keep telling yourself
this is only a game.

272
00:13:02,100 --> 00:13:03,041
We can solve it.

273
00:13:04,260 --> 00:13:05,980
I mean, life's a game!

274
00:13:06,240 --> 00:13:09,652
So what are you going to do
about your kingdom's offering?

275
00:13:09,980 --> 00:13:11,900
Well, I've volunteered.

276
00:13:14,200 --> 00:13:17,977
But don't worry about my fate, for
with the legend comes a prophecy.

277
00:13:18,060 --> 00:13:20,617
And it predicts that epic heroes will come

278
00:13:20,700 --> 00:13:23,300
to Simlao from beyond
the distant mountains.

279
00:13:26,280 --> 00:13:29,140
It is these great heroes who, united,

280
00:13:29,500 --> 00:13:33,217
will create a power that is strong
enough to destroy the mythic dragon.

281
00:13:33,300 --> 00:13:35,177
Are you saying you think that that's us?

282
00:13:35,260 --> 00:13:38,340
You think we're the epic
heroes from the prophecy?

283
00:13:38,900 --> 00:13:39,730
Yes.

284
00:13:39,813 --> 00:13:42,860
On your shoulders rests
the fate of our kingdom.

285
00:13:44,080 --> 00:13:45,097
All right, now.

286
00:13:45,180 --> 00:13:47,860
Super Joey is here to save the day.

287
00:13:48,140 --> 00:13:49,820
Super dork's more like it.

288
00:13:49,940 --> 00:13:52,020
This isn't an eating contest, Joey.

289
00:13:52,180 --> 00:13:53,239
This is dangerous.

290
00:13:53,600 --> 00:13:54,430
Whatever.

291
00:13:54,513 --> 00:13:58,439
We gotta go through that mythic
dragon to rescue Kaiba anyway, right?

292
00:13:58,540 --> 00:14:00,658
The way I see it, there's no choice.

293
00:14:02,040 --> 00:14:07,260
To properly prepare you, we will adorn
you in the manner of our greatest heroes.

294
00:14:09,960 --> 00:14:12,600
A girl like me could get used to this.

295
00:14:12,840 --> 00:14:14,311
How'd you make out, Yugi?

296
00:14:15,200 --> 00:14:16,920
Well, I feel a bit silly.

297
00:14:17,480 --> 00:14:18,310
Silly?

298
00:14:18,393 --> 00:14:19,417
I think you look just great.

299
00:14:19,500 --> 00:14:21,000
If you say so.

300
00:14:21,720 --> 00:14:25,217
You know, Mai, Kaiba Corp's execs
have reprogrammed this game.

301
00:14:25,300 --> 00:14:27,117
You could be putting yourself in danger.

302
00:14:27,200 --> 00:14:28,840
Yugi, did you check me out?

303
00:14:29,020 --> 00:14:31,491
I look way too good to be sitting at home.

304
00:14:31,760 --> 00:14:32,940
You're okay, Mai.

305
00:14:33,200 --> 00:14:34,435
Where's Joey, anyway?

306
00:14:34,920 --> 00:14:35,750
Back here.

307
00:14:35,900 --> 00:14:39,360
And back here is just where
I'm staying, too. Oh, come on.

308
00:14:39,520 --> 00:14:40,755
Don't be such a wimp.

309
00:14:42,400 --> 00:14:44,440
I'm wearing a bathroom rug, Mai.

310
00:14:44,780 --> 00:14:48,780
But Joey, this is the traditional
garb of our bravest national hero.

311
00:14:50,360 --> 00:14:51,190
Lightning!

312
00:14:51,700 --> 00:14:53,465
The storm came out of nowhere.

313
00:14:54,640 --> 00:14:56,057
Something ain't right here.

314
00:14:56,140 --> 00:14:58,787
I've got a real bad
feeling about this, guys.

315
00:14:59,000 --> 00:15:01,857
Princess, it's far too
dangerous for you out here.

316
00:15:01,940 --> 00:15:02,770
Look!

317
00:15:02,853 --> 00:15:04,046
A castle floating in the sky!

318
00:15:06,980 --> 00:15:08,940
The castle of dark illusions.

319
00:15:09,340 --> 00:15:10,577
Never mind the castle.

320
00:15:10,660 --> 00:15:12,397
Look at all those duel monsters.

321
00:15:12,480 --> 00:15:14,777
It looks like they've come
to get their offering.

322
00:15:14,860 --> 00:15:15,690
The princess!

323
00:15:21,940 --> 00:15:23,020
Get ready, guys.

324
00:15:24,660 --> 00:15:27,500
I've never seen so many
Doommasters at one time.

325
00:15:27,880 --> 00:15:29,880
How are we going to stop them all?

326
00:15:30,720 --> 00:15:31,720
Joey, look out!

327
00:15:31,820 --> 00:15:32,757
The armed ninja!

328
00:15:32,840 --> 00:15:35,157
No way he's laying a hand on the princess.

329
00:15:35,240 --> 00:15:36,534
We've got to stop him.

330
00:15:37,300 --> 00:15:38,300
Leave it to me.

331
00:15:38,660 --> 00:15:39,880
Dark Witch, attack!

332
00:15:41,780 --> 00:15:43,520
Two down! This won't work.

333
00:15:43,780 --> 00:15:45,877
There are too many to fight one at a time.

334
00:15:45,960 --> 00:15:47,917
Listen, Mai, summon back your Dark Witch.

335
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:48,830
And then what?

336
00:15:48,913 --> 00:15:50,860
We'll have to use another strategy.

337
00:15:51,400 --> 00:15:53,720
Dark Witch, return! Here's my plan.

338
00:15:54,120 --> 00:15:56,700
I'll activate the Dark Hole Magic Card!

339
00:15:56,900 --> 00:15:59,194
And then they'll be lost in its vortex!

340
00:16:00,540 --> 00:16:01,500
Oh, no!

341
00:16:02,020 --> 00:16:05,360
On the tower, Yugi, the
armed ninja! Yeah, look!

342
00:16:05,620 --> 00:16:09,561
That no-good armed ninja destroyed
your Dark Hole Magic Card, Yugi!

343
00:16:11,900 --> 00:16:12,730
Princess!

344
00:16:12,813 --> 00:16:14,093
Don't let him get away!

345
00:16:14,380 --> 00:16:15,210
X-Raider!

346
00:16:15,620 --> 00:16:17,700
Use kunai with chain to attach!

347
00:16:19,920 --> 00:16:21,020
All right!

348
00:16:21,740 --> 00:16:23,540
The Whiptail Crow got her!

349
00:16:23,680 --> 00:16:24,597
They're getting away!

350
00:16:24,680 --> 00:16:26,020
Princess! Princess!

351
00:16:26,680 --> 00:16:27,510
Adina!

352
00:16:27,640 --> 00:16:28,934
Now, what have I done?

353
00:16:29,120 --> 00:16:31,160
They've taken Mokuba. He's gone.

354
00:16:31,880 --> 00:16:34,320
Mokuba's gone. Mokuba? What?

355
00:16:34,580 --> 00:16:35,680
You're not Mokuba?

356
00:16:36,700 --> 00:16:37,940
Adina? Princess?

357
00:16:38,400 --> 00:16:39,357
But we thought...

358
00:16:39,440 --> 00:16:41,180
So then, they got Mokuba?

359
00:16:41,440 --> 00:16:43,020
Yes, that was him.

360
00:16:43,280 --> 00:16:44,400
He wanted to go.

361
00:16:45,940 --> 00:16:47,500
Switch outfits with me.

362
00:16:48,120 --> 00:16:50,885
I'll go in your place
and join my brother Seto.

363
00:16:51,240 --> 00:16:52,720
It's all my fault.

364
00:16:52,940 --> 00:16:55,260
He was so brave and I was afraid.

365
00:16:55,620 --> 00:16:56,520
Don't you see?

366
00:16:56,720 --> 00:16:59,640
I was the one meant to
be offered, not Okuba.

367
00:17:00,120 --> 00:17:01,900
Please, you must save him.

368
00:17:02,440 --> 00:17:04,640
But how do we reach the Dark Castle?

369
00:17:06,580 --> 00:17:07,620
I don't know.

370
00:17:09,100 --> 00:17:11,920
Look, guys, down there, ancient ruins.

371
00:17:12,180 --> 00:17:13,217
What do you see, Yook?

372
00:17:13,300 --> 00:17:15,077
They must have been
uncovered by the storm.

373
00:17:15,160 --> 00:17:17,880
That symbol of the
legendary flying machine.

374
00:17:18,160 --> 00:17:20,557
Wow, so this is where
your ancient hero hid it.

375
00:17:20,640 --> 00:17:24,860
But even if it's buried under
there, it must be a fossil by now.

376
00:17:25,120 --> 00:17:26,577
How can we ever restore it?

377
00:17:26,660 --> 00:17:29,937
I don't know, but it's our only
hope of rescuing the Kaiba brothers.

378
00:17:30,020 --> 00:17:32,196
Let's go down there and check it out.

379
00:17:32,720 --> 00:17:34,020
Yug, this is hopeless.

380
00:17:34,380 --> 00:17:36,737
There's no way a plane
that old is going to fly.

381
00:17:36,820 --> 00:17:38,040
No, it won't.

382
00:17:38,300 --> 00:17:42,535
That's why we have to restore it to
the way it was a thousand years ago.

383
00:17:42,620 --> 00:17:43,450
Restore it?

384
00:17:43,533 --> 00:17:44,891
But how is that possible?

385
00:17:45,320 --> 00:17:46,150
Of course.

386
00:17:46,280 --> 00:17:47,633
Don't you get it, Joey?

387
00:17:47,980 --> 00:17:51,920
Listen, if the passage of time
corroded the flying machine,

388
00:17:52,460 --> 00:17:55,754
then turning back the clock
will make it as good as new.

389
00:17:56,020 --> 00:17:58,608
And what card can turn
back the clock, Joey?

390
00:17:59,300 --> 00:18:00,130
Oh.

391
00:18:01,320 --> 00:18:04,140
The one you gave me before
Pegasus' tournament.

392
00:18:04,460 --> 00:18:05,520
The time wizard.

393
00:18:05,720 --> 00:18:07,957
It can make things like they
were a thousand years ago.

394
00:18:08,040 --> 00:18:11,117
But if their hands land on skulls,
it'll take our life points.

395
00:18:11,200 --> 00:18:12,337
We've got to risk it.

396
00:18:12,420 --> 00:18:15,280
Seto and Mokuba's future
hang in the balance.

397
00:18:15,900 --> 00:18:16,730
Mm-hmm.

398
00:18:17,120 --> 00:18:18,117
Here goes nothing.

399
00:18:18,200 --> 00:18:19,435
Come on, Time Wizard.

400
00:18:19,600 --> 00:18:21,920
Take these ruins back a thousand years.

401
00:18:22,320 --> 00:18:23,460
Time magic.

402
00:18:23,900 --> 00:18:25,280
Time magic.

403
00:18:26,520 --> 00:18:27,814
Something's happening.

404
00:18:31,160 --> 00:18:33,480
Joey, I think it's working.

405
00:18:34,420 --> 00:18:37,740
The ruins, they're rebuilding
themselves. No, Joey.

406
00:18:38,120 --> 00:18:39,473
Time's rebuilding them.

407
00:18:42,880 --> 00:18:45,180
I don't understand what's happening!

408
00:18:49,620 --> 00:18:51,557
Old Simlao, it's...

409
00:18:51,640 --> 00:18:52,800
it's beautiful.

410
00:18:53,540 --> 00:18:54,800
It didn't work.

411
00:18:58,660 --> 00:19:00,960
I think you spoke too soon, Joey!

412
00:19:01,260 --> 00:19:02,554
Something's happening!

413
00:19:02,820 --> 00:19:03,650
What?

414
00:19:08,420 --> 00:19:10,317
I can't hold him.

415
00:19:10,400 --> 00:19:13,160
Taya, we're in big trouble here.

416
00:19:14,520 --> 00:19:16,280
We've got to hang on.

417
00:19:17,120 --> 00:19:18,980
Yugi, come back soon.

418
00:19:19,280 --> 00:19:22,240
Or you might not be able
to come back at all.
